 "_about": "Curated triggers for listen mode. A picture or clip is shown only when one of its `match` phrases (case-sensitive, whole words; a string starting with ^ is a regex) or `names` occurs in the line being read, and none of its `not` patterns occurs in that line. `names` are people: a bare surname in `names` counts only when it is not preceded by a different given name and not followed by a capitalised word. Items absent from this file are never shown. Every phrase here was counted against the narrated text before it went in; a loose word (Bank, Washington, Article, Reading, East) is what put wrong pictures on screen in the first version.",
